{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50720","headline":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其三 · 张祜","name":"所居即事六首（原注：丹阳闲居寄郑明府如范上人。） 其三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牢落东溪满鬓丝，一身扶杖二男随。\n（《全唐诗》卷五一一据《野客丛书》收此句。\n）鸣鸠在处携书卷，科斗生时想墨池。\n日夕爱琴怜犬子，春风咏雪喜胡儿。\n我家命驾还千里，别与鲈鱼爲後期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}